  "prefLabel": "Ed 1019.02 Authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1019.02 Authority. The implementation of agreed-upon policies, standards, and procedures affecting the overall operation of the vending facilities program shall be subject to review by the committee, as defined in Ed 1019.03(g). SBVI shall have final authority and responsibility for the administration and operation of the vending facilities program.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
